@en He changes trains in Vienna.
@distractor-en gets off
@distractor-en Brussels
@distractor-lu eraklëmmt
@distractor-lu Bréissel

@sentence
@lu Mir klammen an de Waggon an.
@en We board the carriage.
@distractor-en get off
