@distractor-lu Zuch

# --- @fill: prepositions in the travel register ------------------------------
# The blanks keep the location or time phrase intact so the preposition alone is
# the grammar decision; contracted forms are also drilled as single tiles.

@fill
@lu Mäi Zuch fiert [op dem] Quai dräi fort.
@en My train departs [from] platform three.
@distractor-lu um
@distractor-lu zu
@distractor-lu mam
@distractor-en at
@distractor-en in
@distractor-en with

@fill
@lu Mir treffen eis [um] hallwer aacht op der Gare.
@en We meet outside the station [at] half past seven.
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu zu
@distractor-lu mam
@distractor-en on
@distractor-en in
@distractor-en with

@fill
